OL,3,ATrial hears Robinson 'intimidated'
OL,4,ADaily Mail reporters
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolitical activist Tommy Robinson used
OL,7,F"bully-boy, intimidatory tactics" to
OL,8,Ffrighten two Daily Mail journalists,
OL,9,Fforcing them to employ security or
OL,10,Fleave home, a court has heard.
OL,12,FThe 43-year-old from Bedfordshire,
OL,13,Fwhose real name is Stephen
OL,14,FYaxley-Lennon, is charged with two
OL,15,Fcounts of harassment causing fear of
OL,16,Fviolence towards reporters Andrew Young
OL,17,Fand Jacob Dirnhuber.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
