OL,3,ATrial hears Robinson 'intimidated'
OL,4,ADaily Mail reporters
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpening the trial, prosecutor Ben Holt
OL,7,Fsaid the case was about Yaxley-Lennon's
OL,8,Freaction to what he perceived to be "an
OL,9,Funnecessary intrusion into his holiday"
OL,10,Fin the aftermath of the 2024 Southport
OL,11,Fattacks.
OL,13,FRobinson, who founded the English
OL,14,FDefence League, entered not guilty
OL,15,Fpleas to the charges in July last year.
